# Student Information System

A web-based Student Information System developed using Python Flask.

## Project Description

The Student Information System is designed to help manage student records through a simple and organized web interface.

The system allows users to add, view, search, update, and delete student information.

Student records are stored using JSON format.

## Features

- Add new students
- View student records
- Search student records
- Update student information
- Delete student records
- JSON data storage
- Configuration management
- Error handling
- Logging system
- Modular project structure
- Responsive web interface

## Technologies Used

- Python
- Flask
- HTML
- CSS
- JSON
- Git
- GitHub

